oduct margins or lost sales opportunities altogether.","source":"P-0001474432-26-000027","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-25","proof":"bf5dd416e8343ebbad4a93c3df50006991f824d0125e89bda521bde5336897d3"},"P.q.risk.1":{"c":"P","kind":"risk","quote":"We are devoting significant resources toward developing flash storage solutions for hyperscalers, but there can be no assurance that our efforts will lead to meaningful revenue, operating margin or cash flow, or additional hyperscaler design wins.","source":"P-0001474432-26-000027","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-25","proof":"fc07cd550a16f24c080d44592060aced937ae1afedc1f3a5cd733bdc6cf1501d"},"P.q.risk.2":{"c":"P","kind":"risk","quote":"On July 4, 2025, the One Big Beautiful Bill Act (OBBBA) was enacted in the United States; while certain provisions reduced our current tax expense, future interpretations or changes in guidance could materially affect our cash tax obligations, deferred tax positions, and effective tax rate over time.","source":"P-0001474432-26-000027","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-25","proof":"b01d254151fa4735b650e56c79c666f7881eefb2e73d54a482e4aa384309adaf"},"P.q.riskgone.0":{"c":"P","kind":"risk-was","quote":"If we do not manage the supply of our products and their components efficiently, our results of operation could be adversely affected.","source":"P-0001628280-25-015044","section":"Risk factors","date":"2025-03-27","proof":"e7b89f979f7d578ddb449e0c2d111e7758150f1e5b95973218f19c3858549b39"},"P.q.riskrw.0":{"c":"P","kind":"risk","quote":"The evolving market for data storage and data management products makes it difficult to forecast demand for our Everpure Platform.","source":"P-0001474432-26-000027","section":"Risk factors","date":"2026-03-25","proof":"bc6e624694f8301a1593b57c36662bd3aa045b96b7c6963d142903364bf08c60"},"P.q.riskrwwas.0":{"c":"P","kind":"risk-was","quote":"The evolving market for data storage products makes it difficult to forecast demand for our Pure Platform.